  /* SPEECH-HOOK. Speech does not go through these springs. They are the expression's: they make a smile ease in,
     at time constants of 90-160 ms that differ per muscle, and speech run through them was smoothed a second time
     after its own coarticulation blend, its consonants (25-70 ms at the chat's pace) lost, and a shape's muscles
     arriving at different times. The springs below carry the base face (f.bActs, everything that is not speech);
     speech's own activations (f.sActs, f.sJaw, from face-speech.js: the blend, one filter for every channel) are
     added after them. f.acts and f.jaw stay what is drawn, the sum. */
